<title>USA: Eastern Environmental year end results.</title>
<headline>Eastern Environmental year end results.</headline>
<dateline>MT. LAUREL, N.J. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>EASTERN ENVIRONMENTAL SERVICES INC</p>
<p>		 Condensed Consolidated Financial Information</p>
<p>		  ($ in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>		  Year Ended June 30</p>
<p>						   1996		  1995</p>
<p> Revenues				     7,632		 8,651</p>
<p> Gross Profit				   775		 1,221</p>
<p> Operating Loss			   (3,078)	     (1,929)</p>
<p>Loss, net of applicable income tax</p>
<p>   benefit of $0 and $242,000	 (3,500)	     (1,548)</p>
<p> Net loss per share		     ( 0.63)	     ( 0.35)</p>
<p>NOTE: The loss for the fiscal year ended June 30, 1996 included unusual(non-recurring) charges of about $2.69 million, or $0.48 per share reulting from change in control charges, certain valuation changes and a write down of certain equipment and real estate.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
